{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>בהבראם</b> — the letters are באברהם. In the merit of Abraham, heaven and earth were created." "<b>ארץ ושמים</b> — two times in the Masorah: here and the other: \"they acknowledged upon earth and heaven\" (תהילים קמ\"ח:י\"ד). Why did they acknowledge upon earth and heaven? Because He made earth and heaven."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:15:50.718162124Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}